# hangar parameters: sim_vehicle_params
# version 1, set by profiles/sim-direct, 2026-11-26T00:00:00Z
# Surge, sway and heave damping as von Benzon et al. identified them on a
# BlueROV2 heavy in a test facility (J. Mar. Sci. Eng. 10(12):1898, 2022,
# Table A1, "Experimental"): Xu 13.7, Yv 0, Zw 33.0 N s/m; Xu|u| 141.0,
# Yv|v| 217.0, Zw|w| 190.0 N s2/m2. The simulator's defaults are Wu's, from
# another vehicle, and too weak in surge: the speed they give is past the one
# at which the model's pitch is stable, and the vehicle goes over
# (lib/sim/README.md "Pitch under surge"). Roll, pitch and yaw keep the defaults.
# lib/sim's sim_params_damping_vonbenzon() holds the same six numbers.
d_lin = 13.7, 0, 33.0, 0.07, 0.07, 0.07
d_quad = 141.0, 217.0, 190.0, 1.55, 1.55, 1.55
